WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:18.383
Tom looked for Prince Eric at the market.

2
00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:21.587
He saw the prince near an apple cart.

3
00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:27.709
Prince Eric waved. "I found an easy job.

4
00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:35.251
Selling apples!"

5
00:00:35.252 --> 00:00:38.578
A man gave the prince a coin.

6
00:00:38.579 --> 00:00:42.391
Then the man held out his hand.

7
00:00:42.392 --> 00:00:45.876
"Huh?" the prince said.

8
00:00:45.877 --> 00:00:50.264
"The prince doesn’t know how money works," Cat said.

9
00:00:50.265 --> 00:00:55.482
"Servants always buy things for him."

10
00:00:55.483 --> 00:00:58.142
Tom whispered to the prince.

11
00:00:58.143 --> 00:01:01.087
"That man needs some coins back."

12
00:01:01.088 --> 00:01:04.282
"Oh!" said the prince.

13
00:01:04.283 --> 00:01:07.756
He gave the man a bag of coins.

14
00:01:07.757 --> 00:01:14.801
The man laughed.

15
00:01:14.802 --> 00:01:18.178
Another man came to the apple cart.

16
00:01:18.179 --> 00:01:20.800
He held out his hand.

17
00:01:20.801 --> 00:01:27.661
Prince Eric gave him a bag of coins too.

18
00:01:27.662 --> 00:01:31.450
More people ran over.

19
00:01:31.451 --> 00:01:34.227
They pushed each other.

20
00:01:34.228 --> 00:01:37.928
They pushed the prince.

21
00:01:37.929 --> 00:01:41.346
"I must do something!" Tom cried.

22
00:01:41.347 --> 00:01:47.914
Tom waved his wand. "Apple cart, roll back!"

23
00:01:47.915 --> 00:01:50.592
But the apple cart fell over.

24
00:01:50.593 --> 00:01:53.452
Apples rolled everywhere!

25
00:01:53.453 --> 00:01:56.232
"Oops," Tom said.

26
00:01:56.233 --> 00:02:00.017
"My apples!" the apple seller cried.

27
00:02:00.018 --> 00:02:05.815
Tom and the prince hurried away.

28
00:02:05.816 --> 00:02:10.189
"Let's return to the castle," Tom said.

29
00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:12.451
The prince frowned.

30
00:02:12.452 --> 00:02:25.545
"I don't want to do my lessons."

31
00:02:25.546 --> 00:02:33.007
Then he saw some boys fishing.

32
00:02:33.008 --> 00:02:42.270
"I'll be a fisherman!"

33
00:02:42.271 --> 00:02:46.636
The prince ran onto a boat.

34
00:02:46.637 --> 00:03:00.002
Tom sighed and followed him.

35
00:03:00.003 --> 00:03:02.722
"Uh-oh," Cat whispered.

36
00:03:02.723 --> 00:03:17.616
"This boat is leaking!"

